OL,3,AHow being music's Mr Nice Guy
OL,4,Acontributed to biggest crisis of Ed
OL,5,ASheeran's career
OL,6,
OL,7,FSinger Ed Sheeran is facing the biggest
OL,8,Fcontroversy of his career after a storm
OL,9,Fover a decision to drop support act
OL,10,FMacklemore from his US stadium tour
OL,11,Ffollowing the rapper's on-stage
OL,12,Fpro-Palestinian comments.
OL,14,FSheeran is one of the most successful
OL,15,Fsongwriters of all time. He has sold
OL,16,Fmore than 120 million records and spent
OL,17,Fmore than 1,000 weeks on the US album
OL,18,Fcharts.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
