OL,3,AHow being music's Mr Nice Guy
OL,4,Acontributed to biggest crisis of Ed
OL,5,ASheeran's career
OL,6,
OL,7,FPart of his appeal - apart from those
OL,8,Finsidiously catchy songs - is his
OL,9,Feveryman persona. He looks and dresses
OL,10,Flike a fan on the train home from
OL,11,FGlastonbury, rather than one of the
OL,12,Ffestival's headliners.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
